# Documentation claims

Claim vocabulary lives in `docs/README.md`. Do not invent a parallel scheme.

Two axes. Evidence strength is the ledger tag. Novelty — `KNOWN`, `REPARAMETERIZATION`, `PROJECT-SPECIFIC`, `OPEN` — is prose annotation and never a ledger tag.

Live publication task is the Juggler programme (Paper A / Paper B).
The rewrite note remains ready to send. Cubic Newton stratum stays
STRUCTURAL / parked; not a new-math frontier.

1. `docs/theory/juggler_finite_dynamics_note.md`
2. `docs/theory/juggler_parity_discrepancy_note.md`
3. `docs/juggler_branch_ledger.md`
4. `docs/theory/rewrite_calculus_note.md` (ready to send)
5. `docs/theory/balanced_ternary_calculus.md`
6. `docs/theory/cubic_newton_stratum.md`
